18	/// and an optional remote image URL. Authors resolve to a Gravatar (by email, `d=404` so unknown
19	/// emails fall through); reviewers to `github.com/<login>.png`; teams have no image. When the URL is
20	/// nil, still loading, or 404s/decodes-empty, the coloured initials chip shows instead.
21	struct AvatarSubject: Hashable {
